Package: neuroconsumer
Title: Controlled Visual Experimentation in Consumer Research
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Pablo", "Sánchez-Núñez", email = "psancheznunez@outlook.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7845-9506"))
Description: An experimental toolkit for constructing, manipulating, validating,
    and documenting visual stimuli in consumer research and advertising studies.
    Provides declarative specification of experimental factors, deterministic
    rendering of vector stimuli (SVG/PNG), automatic generation of areas of
    interest for eye tracking with persistent identifiers, and checks that
    experimental conditions differ only in the declared dimensions.
